<h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>

<p><strong>How do I change the language or theme (light/dark)?</strong><br>
Go to the "Settings" tab in the app — you can change the language (Spanish/English) and appearance (light, dark, or automatic based on your device) at any time.</p>

<p><strong>How do I turn on or change the daily reminder?</strong><br>
In "Settings" → "Daily reminder", turn on the switch and pick the time you prefer. You can turn it off whenever you want.</p>

<p><strong>How does the Collection and link-unlock feature work?</strong><br>
Every verse you see is automatically added to your Collection. If a friend shares a verse with you and you already have the app installed, opening their link also unlocks that verse in your own collection.</p>

<p><strong>Will I lose my data if I uninstall the app?</strong><br>
All your data (favorites, collection, streak, settings) is stored only on your device. Uninstalling the app removes it, unless your operating system's automatic backups are enabled.</p>

<p><strong>Why do I see ads?</strong><br>
Daily Bread is free. The ads (a small banner, and at most one full-screen ad per day) are what let us keep the app running and keep improving it without charging a subscription.</p>

<p><strong>I found a bug / the app crashes / something isn't working</strong><br>
Email us at <a href="mailto:the365partner@gmail.com">the365partner@gmail.com</a> and tell us what happened, on which screen, and what phone model you're using — it helps us fix it quickly.</p>

